Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Mengonfigurasi Windows 10 & 11 agar selalu menggunakan GPU High Performance (Dedicated GPU: NVIDIA GeForce / AMD Radeon / Intel Arc) untuk scrcpy
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\DirectX\UserGpuPreferences]
"C:\\AndroidMirrorPC\\scrcpy.exe"="GpuPreference=2;"
"scrcpy.exe"="GpuPreference=2;"
